Fucking McDonaldburger's is taking over.
McDonaldburger ກໍາ ລັງຮັບຜິດຊອບ.

105
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:17,700
[DONNA HAWTHORNE]
Hello?
ສະບາຍດີ?

