Yeah. And we use also use it for playback on five other houses. So you'll be bumping into other undercover people. Always wear your scramble suit.
ແມ່ນແລ້ວ. ແລະພວກເຮົາຍັງໃຊ້ມັນ ສໍາ ລັບການຫຼິ້ນໃນເຮືອນອີກຫ້າເຮືອນ
