[COP]
I'm sorry.
ຂ້ອຍຂໍໂທດ.

995
01:08:39,750 --> 01:08:41,750
[DONNA HAWTHORNE]
Just fucking take off.
ພຽງແຕ່ບິນໄປ.

996
01:08:42,250 --> 01:08:44,350
